        "user": "Please analyze the attached image of an English essay and evaluate it based on these criteria:\n\nHandwriting Standards (50 points total):\n1. Consistency of letter size (15 points)\n2. Uniformity of spacing (10 points)\n3. Standardization of stroke connections (10 points)\n4. Roundness of glyphs (10 points)\n5. Overall aesthetics (5 points)\n\nContent Quality (50 points total):\n1. Clarity of theme (10 points)\n2. Completeness of structure (10 points)\n3. Fluency of language (10 points)\n4. Vocabulary usage (10 points)\n5. Diversity of sentence patterns (10 points)\n\nProvide scores for each criterion and give an overall evaluation of the essay. Respond in this format:\n\nHandwriting Scores:\n- Letter size consistency: [score]/15\n- Spacing uniformity: [score]/10\n- Stroke connections: [score]/10\n- Glyph roundness: [score]/10\n- Overall aesthetics: [score]/5\n\nContent Scores:\n- Theme clarity: [score]/10\n- Structure completeness: [score]/10\n- Language fluency: [score]/10\n- Vocabulary usage: [score]/10\n- Sentence pattern diversity: [score]/10\n\nOverall Evaluation:\n[your detailed evaluation]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "type": "code",
      "param": {
        "variables": [
          ["evaluation", ["text", "3"]]
        ],
        "outputs": [
          ["result", "object"]
        ],
        "code": "import re\n\ndef main(evaluation: str):\n    # Initialize scores\n    scores = {\n        'handwriting': {},\n        'content': {}\n    }\n    \n    # Extract handwriting scores\n    letter_size_match = re.search(r'Letter size consistency: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    spacing_match = re.search(r'Spacing uniformity: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    stroke_match = re.search(r'Stroke connections: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    glyph_match = re.search(r'Glyph roundness: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    aesthetics_match = re.search(r'Overall aesthetics: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    \n    # Extract content scores\n    theme_match = re.search(r'Theme clarity: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    structure_match = re.search(r'Structure completeness: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    fluency_match = re.search(r'Language fluency: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    vocabulary_match = re.search(r'Vocabulary usage: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    sentence_match = re.search(r'Sentence pattern diversity: (\\d+)', evaluation)\n    \n    # Parse scores\n    scores['handwriting'] = {\n        'letter_size_consistency': int(letter_size_match.group(1)) if letter_size_match else 0,\n        'spacing_uniformity': int(spacing_match.group(1)) if spacing_match else 0,\n        'stroke_connections': int(stroke_match.group(1)) if stroke_match else 0,\n        'glyph_roundness': int(glyph_match.group(1)) if glyph_match else 0,\n        'overall_aesthetics': int(aesthetics_match.group(1)) if aesthetics_match else 0\n    }\n    \n    scores['content'] = {\n        'theme_clarity': int(theme_match.group(1)) if theme_match else 0,\n        'structure_completeness': int(structure_match.group(1)) if structure_match else 0,\n        'language_flency': int(fluency_match.group(1)) if fluency_match else 0,\n        'vocabulary_usage': int(vocabulary_match.group(1)) if vocabulary_match else 0,\n        'sentence_pattern_diversity': int(sentence_match.group(1)) if sentence_match else 0\n    }\n    \n    # Calculate totals\n    handwriting_total = sum(scores['handwriting'].values())\n    content_total = sum(scores['content'].values())\n    total_score = handwriting_total + content_total\n    \n    # Extract overall evaluation\n    overall_evaluation = \"\"\n    if \"Overall Evaluation:\" in evaluation:\n        overall_evaluation = evaluation.split(\"Overall Evaluation:\")[1].strip()\n    \n    # Create result object\n    result = {\n        \"total_score\": total_score,\n        \"handwriting_total\": handwriting_total,\n        \"content_total\": content_total,\n        \"scores\": scores,\n        \"overall_evaluation\": overall_evaluation\n    }\n    \n    return {\n        \"result\": result\n    }"
      }
    },
